so hold on one second.

01:33:38.660 --> 01:33:46.390 align:middle line:90%


01:33:46.390 --> 01:33:48.710 align:middle line:90%
Yeah.

01:33:48.710 --> 01:33:49.230 align:middle line:90%
OK.

01:33:49.230 --> 01:33:49.730 align:middle line:90%
Yeah.

01:33:49.730 --> 01:33:52.770 align:middle line:84%
So the way to think about
this-- sorry about that.

01:33:52.770 --> 01:33:55.100 align:middle line:84%
The way to think
about it is to think

01:33:55.100 --> 01:34:00.460 align:middle line:90%
of this as chi of P and Zi.

01:34:00.460 --> 01:34:03.440 align:middle line:90%
It's low degree in this.

01:34:03.440 --> 01:34:05.480 align:middle line:90%
