01:34:11.070 --> 01:34:11.570 align:middle line:90%
sorry.

01:34:11.570 --> 01:34:17.000 align:middle line:84%
You can think of chi as
being in H to the m times

01:34:17.000 --> 01:34:20.108 align:middle line:90%
f to the m to whatever to--

01:34:20.108 --> 01:34:30.570 align:middle line:90%


01:34:30.570 --> 01:34:41.350 align:middle line:90%
STUDENT: [INAUDIBLE]

01:34:41.350 --> 01:34:43.450 align:middle line:84%
YAEL KALAI: I'm not
