01:35:14.710 --> 01:35:16.370 align:middle line:90%
OK, let me fix this.

01:35:16.370 --> 01:35:19.270 align:middle line:90%
Sorry about that.

01:35:19.270 --> 01:35:23.330 align:middle line:90%
Instead of this, think of chi--

01:35:23.330 --> 01:35:25.250 align:middle line:90%
I'm just changing the notation--

01:35:25.250 --> 01:35:30.573 align:middle line:84%
H1 up to Hm Z, which
is Z1 up to Zm.

01:35:30.573 --> 01:35:31.990 align:middle line:84%
I don't want to
