01:38:25.990 --> 01:38:32.430 align:middle line:84%
So this is just
chi of Z0 and Xi.

01:38:32.430 --> 01:38:34.780 align:middle line:90%
Thank you.

01:38:34.780 --> 01:38:35.380 align:middle line:90%
Yeah.

01:38:35.380 --> 01:38:37.297 align:middle line:84%
STUDENT: I guess what I
