it's not a polynomial in Hi?

01:39:51.730 --> 01:39:52.850 align:middle line:90%
YAEL KALAI: No, it is.

01:39:52.850 --> 01:39:53.590 align:middle line:90%
It is.

01:39:53.590 --> 01:39:54.877 align:middle line:90%
